{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05623","headline":"和左司张员外自洛使入京中路先赴长安逢立春日赠韦侍御等诸公 · 孙逖","name":"和左司张员外自洛使入京中路先赴长安逢立春日赠韦侍御等诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拜郎登省闼，奉使驰车乘。\n遥瞻使者星，便是郎官应。\n台妙时相许，皇华德弥称。\n二陕听风谣，三秦望形胜。\n此中暌益友，是日多诗兴。\n寒尽岁阴催，春归物华证。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}